# The type checker the type check job runs (.github/workflows/ci.yml), and the
# stubs for the two third-party libraries the checked modules import, PyYAML
# and jsonschema. Which modules it checks, and how, is `[tool.mypy]` in
# pyproject.toml.
#
# Regenerate the hash-pinned lock file after editing:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.10 requirements/typecheck.in -o requirements/typecheck.txt
mypy
types-PyYAML
types-jsonschema
